### 2. Player Initialization Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    START[Player Connects] --> GET_CONTROLLER[Get PlayerController]
    GET_CONTROLLER --> CHECK_SLOT{Player in Slot?}
    
    CHECK_SLOT -->|No| SPECTATOR[Spectator Path]
    CHECK_SLOT -->|Yes| PLAYABLE[Playable Character Path]
    
    subgraph "Spectator Path"
        SPECTATOR --> CREATE_SPEC[CreateSpectatorEntity]
        CREATE_SPEC --> CHECK_EXISTING{Existing Spectator?}
        CHECK_EXISTING -->|Yes| REUSE[Reuse Existing]
        CHECK_EXISTING -->|No| SPAWN_SPEC[Spawn New Spectator]
        SPAWN_SPEC --> ASSIGN_SPEC[SetInitialMainEntity]
        REUSE --> ASSIGN_SPEC
        ASSIGN_SPEC --> SPEC_FACTION[Assign SPEC Faction]
    end
    
    subgraph "Playable Character Path"
        PLAYABLE --> CAPTURE_OLD[Capture Old Entity]
        CAPTURE_OLD --> GET_OR_CREATE[GetOrCreatePlayableCharacter]
        GET_OR_CREATE --> CHECK_EXISTS{Character Exists?}
        CHECK_EXISTS -->|Yes| REUSE_CHAR[Reuse Character]
        CHECK_EXISTS -->|No| SPAWN_CHAR[SpawnPlayableEntity]
        SPAWN_CHAR --> APPLY_GEAR[Apply Gearscript]
        REUSE_CHAR --> NOTIFY_DC[Notify DataCollector]
        APPLY_GEAR --> NOTIFY_DC
        NOTIFY_DC --> DELETE_OLD[Delete Old Entity]
        DELETE_OLD --> ASSIGN_FACTION[Assign Faction]
    end
    
    SPEC_FACTION --> INITIALIZE[InitializePlayerCharacter]
    ASSIGN_FACTION --> INITIALIZE
    INITIALIZE --> VERIFY[VerifyCharacterAssignment]
    VERIFY --> CHECK_SUCCESS{Assignment OK?}
    CHECK_SUCCESS -->|No| RETRY[Retry Assignment]
    RETRY --> VERIFY
    CHECK_SUCCESS -->|Yes| ASSIGN_GROUP[Assign to Group]
    ASSIGN_GROUP --> BROADCAST[Broadcast Player Ready]
    BROADCAST --> END[Player Initialized]
```

