### 4. Gearscript System

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    START[SetEntityGear Called] --> CHECK_RACING{Already Being Geared?}
    CHECK_RACING -->|Yes| SKIP[Skip - Race Condition]
    CHECK_RACING -->|No| MARK[Mark as Being Geared]
    
    MARK --> GET_FACTION[Determine Faction]
    GET_FACTION --> GET_CONFIG[Load Gearscript Config]
    GET_CONFIG --> CLEAR[Clear Existing Gear]
    CLEAR --> DELAY[500ms Delay]
    
    DELAY --> APPLY_CLOTHING[Apply Clothing]
    APPLY_CLOTHING --> WAIT[500ms Wait]
    
    WAIT --> CONSOLIDATED[ApplyGearConsolidated]
    
    subgraph "Consolidated Gear Application"
        CONSOLIDATED --> WEAPONS[Apply Weapons]
        CONSOLIDATED --> ITEMS[Apply Inventory Items]
        CONSOLIDATED --> RADIOS[Initialize Radios]
        
        WEAPONS --> CHECK_CUSTOM{Custom Weapons?}
        CHECK_CUSTOM -->|Yes| CUSTOM_WEP[Apply Custom Weapons]
        CHECK_CUSTOM -->|No| DEFAULT_WEP[Apply Default Weapons]
        
        DEFAULT_WEP --> SELECT_WEP[Select Weapons by Role]
        SELECT_WEP --> SPAWN_WEP[Spawn Weapons]
        SPAWN_WEP --> ADD_MAGS[Add Magazines]
        
        CUSTOM_WEP --> SPAWN_CUSTOM[Spawn Custom Loadout]
        SPAWN_CUSTOM --> ADD_MAGS
        
        ITEMS --> DEFAULT_ITEMS[Default Inventory Items]
        ITEMS --> MEDICAL[Medical Items]
        ITEMS --> ROLE_ITEMS[Role-Specific Items]
        
        DEFAULT_ITEMS --> RADIOS
        MEDICAL --> RADIOS
        ROLE_ITEMS --> RADIOS
    end
    
    RADIOS --> ATTACH_DELAY[1200ms Attachment Delay]
    ATTACH_DELAY --> FINISH[Mark Gearing Complete]
    FINISH --> READY[Entity Ready]
```

