### 5. Safestart System

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    START[SafestartManager Init] --> FRAME[Fixed Frame Updates]
    
    FRAME --> CHECK_INIT{Init Complete?}
    CHECK_INIT -->|No| UPDATE_FACTIONS[Update Played Factions]
    CHECK_INIT -->|Yes| CHECK_ACTIVE{Safestart Active?}
    
    UPDATE_FACTIONS --> COUNT_PLAYERS[Count Slotted Players by Faction]
    COUNT_PLAYERS --> READY_CHECK[Check Faction Ready Status]
    
    CHECK_ACTIVE -->|Yes| COUNTDOWN{Countdown Mode?}
    CHECK_ACTIVE -->|No| FRAME
    
    COUNTDOWN -->|Yes| TIME_COUNTDOWN[Decrement Timer]
    COUNTDOWN -->|No| READY_COUNTDOWN[Check All Factions Ready]
    
    TIME_COUNTDOWN --> ZERO{Timer = 0?}
    ZERO -->|Yes| END_SAFESTART[End Safestart]
    ZERO -->|No| FRAME
    
    READY_COUNTDOWN --> ALL_READY{All Ready?}
    ALL_READY -->|Yes| END_SAFESTART
    ALL_READY -->|No| FRAME
    
    subgraph "Safestart Effects"
        END_SAFESTART --> REMOVE_GOD[Remove God Mode]
