### 6. Respawn System

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    START[Player Dies] --> MARK_DEAD[Mark Player as Dead]
    MARK_DEAD --> CHECK_TICKETS{Faction Has Tickets?}
    
    CHECK_TICKETS -->|No| PERMANENT_DEAD[Spectator Only]
    CHECK_TICKETS -->|Yes| DECREMENT[Decrement Ticket]
    
    DECREMENT --> WAVE_SYSTEM{Wave Respawn?}
    WAVE_SYSTEM -->|Yes| WAIT_WAVE[Wait for Respawn Wave]
    WAVE_SYSTEM -->|No| INSTANT[Instant Respawn Available]
    
    WAIT_WAVE --> WAVE_TIMER{Wave Timer Ready?}
    WAVE_TIMER -->|No| WAIT_WAVE
    WAVE_TIMER -->|Yes| PROCESS_WAVE[Process Respawn Wave]
    
    PROCESS_WAVE --> BATCH[Batch All Waiting Players]
    BATCH --> RESPAWN_EACH[Respawn Each Player]
    
    INSTANT --> PLAYER_REQUEST[Player Requests Respawn]
    PLAYER_REQUEST --> RESPAWN_EACH
    
    subgraph "Respawn Process"
        RESPAWN_EACH --> FIND_POINT[Find Respawn Point]
        FIND_POINT --> GET_SLOT[Get Player Slot]
        GET_SLOT --> SPAWN_NEW[Spawn New Character]
        SPAWN_NEW --> APPLY_GEAR[Apply Gearscript]
        APPLY_GEAR --> ASSIGN_PLAYER[Assign to Player]
    end
    
    ASSIGN_PLAYER --> BACK_IN_GAME[Player Respawned]
```

