## Key Data Flow Paths

### 1. Player Join Flow
```
Player Connects
    → PlayerController Created
    → GamemodeManager.InitializePlayer()
    → Check Slot Status
    → Create Spectator OR Spawn Character
    → Apply Gearscript (if slotted)
    → Assign to Faction
    → Assign to Group
    → Broadcast Player Ready
```

### 2. Slot Selection Flow
```
Player Clicks Slot
    → Client sends RPC to Server
    → PermissionManager validates
    → SlottingManager checks availability
    → Assign player to slot
    → Spawn new character entity
    → GearscriptManager applies loadout
    → Update UI for all clients
    → Log event
```

### 3. Game Phase Transition Flow
```
Admin/Timer triggers phase change
    → Server updates game state
    → Broadcast RPC to all clients
    → Clients update UI
    → Activate/deactivate systems per phase
    → Log transition
```

### 4. Respawn Flow
```
Player dies
    → Mark player as dead
    → Check respawn tickets
    → Add to respawn queue (if wave)
    → Wait for wave timer OR player request
    → Find respawn point
    → Spawn new character
    → Apply gearscript
    → Assign to player
    → Delete old corpse (via GarbageManager)
```

